WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.319
Here is how buying a Calyx Expert Advisor works, from the catalogue to a running

2
00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:06.499
MetaTrader 5 chart.

3
00:00:06.499 --> 00:00:10.598
It takes a few minutes, and you can pay with USDT from any wallet.

4
00:00:11.698 --> 00:00:13.954
Everything starts on the Calyx store.

5
00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:18.831
Every robot is listed with its real historical evidence, its limitations and the

6
00:00:18.831 --> 00:00:20.904
exact settings the installer uses.

7
00:00:20.904 --> 00:00:23.770
Prices are now forty percent lower than before.

8
00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:30.454
Open the catalogue to filter by asset, symbol or evidence status, and sort by profit

9
00:00:30.454 --> 00:00:33.513
factor, drawdown, Sharpe ratio or trade count.

10
00:00:33.513 --> 00:00:37.302
Each card shows the new price next to the old list price.

11
00:00:38.402 --> 00:00:43.516
On a robot's page you read how the installed version actually trades, the risk notes

12
00:00:43.516 --> 00:00:45.221
and the backtest statistics.

13
00:00:45.221 --> 00:00:47.779
When you are convinced, press Add to cart.

14
00:00:47.779 --> 00:00:50.762
One license covers one live and one demo account.

15
00:00:51.862 --> 00:00:56.275
The cart applies the pack rule automatically: buy three, get one free.

16
00:00:56.275 --> 00:01:00.499
For every four robots in your cart, the cheapest one costs nothing.

17
00:01:00.499 --> 00:01:04.030
With eight robots, the two cheapest are free, and so on.

18
00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:10.995
At checkout, enter your email, choose the network, TRC20 on Tron or BEP20 on BNB

19
00:01:10.995 --> 00:01:14.880
Smart Chain, and optionally your MT5 account numbers.

20
00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:18.546
Confirm the license terms and the risk disclosure.

21
00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:24.651
Your order page shows the deposit address, a QR code and the exact amount.

22
00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:27.695
The few extra cents make your payment unique.

23
00:01:27.695 --> 00:01:31.077
In this video every payment value is a demo value.

24
00:01:31.077 --> 00:01:33.917
Send only USDT, only on the network shown.

25
00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:36.758
A wrong network or token means lost funds.

26
00:01:37.858 --> 00:01:40.071
The store reads the public blockchain.

27
00:01:40.071 --> 00:01:44.846
After the required confirmations, the page switches to Payment confirmed and shows

28
00:01:44.846 --> 00:01:48.514
one license key per robot, with a download button for each one.

29
00:01:49.614 --> 00:01:55.087
Each download is a small ZIP: the compiled robot, a settings file with your license

30
00:01:55.087 --> 00:02:00.363
key already filled in, a one click install BAT file, the PowerShell installer, a

31
00:02:00.363 --> 00:02:02.275
read me and the license text.

32
00:02:02.275 --> 00:02:03.726
Extract the ZIP first.

33
00:02:04.826 --> 00:02:06.694
Double click the INSTALL file.

34
00:02:06.694 --> 00:02:11.738
It lists your MetaTrader 5 terminals, skips test and tester folders, and asks for

35
00:02:11.738 --> 00:02:14.914
your broker's symbol name, because suffixes differ.

36
00:02:14.914 --> 00:02:18.650
It copies the robot, the settings and a ready chart profile.

37
00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:24.970
The robot checks its license online, so MetaTrader must allow the Calyx server.

38
00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:28.671
If MetaTrader was closed, the installer adds it for you.

39
00:02:28.671 --> 00:02:34.221
Otherwise open Tools, Options, Expert Advisors, allow web requests and add the Calyx

40
00:02:34.221 --> 00:02:34.750
address.

41
00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.525
Next, open File, Profiles, and choose the Calyx profile.

42
00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:44.907
The chart opens on your symbol and timeframe with the robot and its inputs already

43
00:02:44.907 --> 00:02:45.498
attached.

44
00:02:46.598 --> 00:02:48.524
Nothing trades until you decide.

45
00:02:48.524 --> 00:02:53.580
Press F7 on the chart, tick Allow Algo Trading on the Common tab, then switch on the

46
00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.687
Algo Trading button in the toolbar.

47
00:02:55.687 --> 00:02:57.974
The installer never does this for you.

48
00:02:59.074 --> 00:03:00.949
Finally, check the Experts tab.

49
00:03:00.949 --> 00:03:04.335
It should say the license is activated for your account.

50
00:03:04.335 --> 00:03:09.112
The license is checked again every twenty four hours, with seventy two hours of

51
00:03:09.112 --> 00:03:11.410
grace if the server cannot be reached.

52
00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:13.185
That is it.

53
00:03:13.185 --> 00:03:18.213
Start on your demo account, keep your order link safe, and remember that backtests

54
00:03:18.213 --> 00:03:20.543
are evidence, not a promise of profit.

55
00:03:20.543 --> 00:03:22.076
Questions before you buy?

56
00:03:22.076 --> 00:03:23.670
Message Calyx on WhatsApp.
